rivate_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\nI noticed an issue with 3D resolution scaling on macOS + Metal (or MoltenVK) though. The glow buffer doesn't appear to be scaled, so it will appear at the wrong position if the resolution scale isn't `1.0`. Note that this issue does not occur if using MetalFX Spatial, only with Bilinear (FSR 1.0 isn't supported on Mobile).\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_glow_mobile.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22152576/test_glow_mobile.zip)\r\n\r\nScale 0.25 | Scale 1.0 | Scale 2.0\r\n-|-|-\r\n<img width=\"967\" height=\"499\" alt=\"1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/feb8af51-6e09-4d0f-9d9a-6e909e1c3f5b\" /> | <img width=\"976\" height=\"485\" alt=\"2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1e16f2d5-73a4-4ceb-8914-a322d97bfdb7\" /> | <img width=\"1031\" height=\"450\" alt=\"3\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/948e3fd9-20be-4713-9a8b-151b6df61381\" />\r\n\r\nScale 0.25 with MetalFX Spatial (looks correct):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"779\" height=\"450\" alt=\"4\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1535ae66-8bfb-45ce-93d2-b7cd5ddb33d0\" />\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110077#pullrequestreview-3187239974","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110077","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-09-04T21:02:22Z"},{"id":3250039170,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Bt6mC","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?u=6e9313e254649f6dc55e92536596487ac10bf5a2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","login":"allenwp","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"